  "body": "Positioned in a family-friendly cul-de-sac, 53 Nautilus Drive offers the perfect blend of space, comfort, and lifestyle in the heart of Gulf Harbour. This two-storey freehold home is an outstanding opportunity for first home buyers, growing families, or savvy investors looking to secure a quality property in a prime coastal location.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the spacious open-plan layout features a modern kitchen equipped with a six-burner gas hob, a generous living area and a separate tiled dining space flowing out to a large, sun-soaked private deck - ideal for entertaining, relaxing, or enjoying long summer evenings.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master with ensuite and family bathroom with bath and separate shower - perfect for busy households. Comfort is paramount here with a heat pump, ducted air conditioning unit and smart ventilation system all in place. Practicality meets convenience with a single internal access garage and tandem off-street parking for two more vehicles.\r\n\r\nSituated just minutes from stunning beaches, Gulf Harbour Primary School, Wentworth College and Primary, and Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n\r\nThis is coastal living with everything you need at your doorstep.\r\nCall today to arrange your viewing - homes like this don't stay on the market for long.",
